# Skill bar icons, one line per SkillId, IN SkillId ORDER (src/skill.h).
#
#   <SkillId>  <author>/<icon>
#
# Art from https://game-icons.net, CC BY 3.0 - the author half of each
# path is the person to credit, which is why the attribution in
# assets/CREDITS.md is generated from this file rather than typed out.
#
# Rebuild the atlas with:  python3 tools/build_icon_atlas.py
# The script refuses to run if this list and the SkillId enum disagree,
# so an icon can never silently end up on the wrong skill.

SK_GASH                 lorc/sword-wound
SK_RUSH_STRIKE          delapouite/sword-brandish
