SK_CLAW_SWIPE           lorc/claw-slashes
SK_DISTRACTING_BLOW     delapouite/shield-bash
SK_FERAL_HOWL           lorc/wolf-howl
SK_ORISON_OF_HEALING    delapouite/healing
SK_BANISH               lorc/sunbeams
